<title>CANADA: Husky sets Moose Mountain, Alberta pipeline plan.</title>
<headline>Husky sets Moose Mountain, Alberta pipeline plan.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Long-awaited production from the Moose Mountain oil play in Alberta moved a step closer on Friday with an application by Husky Oil Operations Ltd to build a pipeline from its wells.</p>
<p>Husky said it and partner Rigel Energy Corp applied to Alberta's Energy and Utilities board to build a 25 km pipeline to connect two wells to another line that flows to Shell Canada Ltd's Jumping Pound Gas Plant in the southwest part of the province.</p>
</text>
